<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24682" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδείκνῡμι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δείξω,</span>
		
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δέξω,</span> strengthd. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείκνυμι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>show plainly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.162
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρόνημα καὶ μέγεθος ἀρετῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.968d
				</span></i>
			: folld. by a relat. clause with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.172
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.58
			</span></i>: also c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδεξάτω τις βασιλέος κηδόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.118
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὴν Ἑλλήνων ἀλκὴν ἀπρόσμαχον
					οὖσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arat.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>display,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμέλειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					778.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>:— 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδεικνύσθω ἐὼν πολέμιος</span>
			<i>let him be declared</i> the king's enemy, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.72
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθοὶ διεδείχθησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					11.105
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Gaz.
				<u>Thphr.</u>
				p.56
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> sts. intr. in forms
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέδεξε</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς διέδεξε,</span>
			<i>it was clear, manifest,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.82
			</span></i>.</div>
